{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_34_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_34","textTraditional":"一、五年，春，王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_34_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_34","textTraditional":"二、夏，夫人姜氏如齊師。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_34_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_34","textTraditional":"師而曰如，眾也。婦人既嫁不踰竟，踰竟，非禮也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_34_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_34","textTraditional":"三、秋，郳黎來來朝。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_34_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_34","textTraditional":"郳，國也。黎來，微國之君，未爵命者也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_34_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_34","textTraditional":"四、冬，公會齊人、宋人、陳人、蔡人伐衞。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_34_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_34","textTraditional":"是齊侯宋公也，其曰人何也？人諸侯，所以人公也。其人公何也？逆天王之命也。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}